  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACQUIRING 10 ACRES LAND FOR PROJECT SUSTAINABILITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposed project is aiming at acquiring 10 acres of land that shall be used for agricultural practices and in this way shall help us to alleviate hunger and create self-sustainability at H4HU and the communities where it operates.  We believe that if we can acquire this agricultural land, the project shall be able to grow enough food to feed children under its care, destitute widows and vulnerable elderly people who can&apos;t make it through the day.</narrative>
  </description>
